#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"I</proc> -- Mount point for the proc filesystem, which gives access to "
"kernel status information via the following files."
